// ROOT-CUT RECEIPT, attached to this authority rather than minted as a second migration ledger.
// The four perturbations were made only in copies of one preserved emitted artifact; none is a
// proposed per-module repair. Their successor identities show that changing one consumer merely
// moves the carrier boundary. The production X named here is therefore #9813's module-wide flat
// TypeEnv binding (import union -> kernel overlay -> direct-selected overlay with kernel names
// skipped). The replacement Y is the authority above: one exact declaration binding per
// TypeOccurrence, derived from containment/qualification and carried through typecheck and emit.
data type_reference_containment_binding_string_root_cut_receipt: String = "MEASURED with gunbc.instruments.emission_entry_instrument over src/v2/compiler/00_compile.dag. The run identity, producer digests, refusal, split replay, and coded/codeless counts are carried together by type_reference_containment_binding_emitted_rust_split_census; the combined instrument produced no cargo population after 15 EAGAIN failures, so its output is not the source of the count. String is the only v2.std top-level declaration colliding with the Rust prelude; 18 closure modules import v2.std.text.String and all 18 emit zero exact v2_std_text::String use-lines with nonzero bare String spellings. Throwaway-copy identity deltas over one preserved emitted tree, with no netting: tokenize use-line vanished 41 incumbent E0308, persisted zero of those identities, and newly appeared 12 NewlyExposedByRootCut identities; tokenize occurrence qualification vanished the same 41, persisted zero, and newly appeared 11, including the same six downstream identities; target_model use-line vanished six of seven incumbent identities (E0277, E0282, E0599, three E0308), persisted one E0308, and newly appeared 17; target_model occurrence qualification vanished the same six, persisted the same one E0308, and newly appeared a different population of 28. The target_model four-code spectrum moved together under one carrier-binding decision. No local import-line, emitted-qualification, or per-consumer respelling establishes one representation through the dependency chain. Production X being retired is #9813's module-wide flat TypeEnv precedence; replacement Y is one exact declaration binding per TypeOccurrence through resolve_type_reference_containment_binding, consumed by typecheck and emission without re-resolution through X."

// Positive evidence, not the missing-guarantee denominator. These occurrences already spell the
// intended Y identity explicitly; counting them as residue would read a selection view as the
// population authority. The future denominator is every production TypeOccurrence currently
// bound through X, partitioned by old/new occurrence-binding result.
data type_reference_containment_binding_structural_text_positive_subset_receipt: String = "AlreadyOccurrenceBoundStructuralText is the typed type_reference_containment_binding_structural_text_positive_subset: 30 hand-authored v2.std.text.String occurrences across src/v2, 29 inside the measured compiler closure and one outside it. All 30 positions require the structural carrier, but the set is an independently-derived positive subset, never a drop population or denominator. The unmeasured denominator is every production TypeOccurrence whose declaration identity currently comes through the flat TypeEnv/precedence path; this instrument did not enumerate that population. Replacement-census partitions: OldAndNewAgree, OldAndNewDisagree, OldBinds_NewUnresolved, OldBinds_NewAmbiguous, OldUnresolved_NewBinds."

// The tokenizer root-cut probe's twelve successors remain named so the migration cannot net them
// off against the 41 incumbents. Multiplicity is part of identity where one source symbol contains
// more than one distinct failing occurrence; emitted line numbers are deliberately absent.
data type_reference_containment_binding_newly_exposed_string_identities_receipt: String = "NewlyExposedByRootCut after structuralizing tokenizer is carried by type_reference_containment_binding_newly_exposed_string_identities: ten declaration-and-code identities whose typed multiplicities total 12. They are fix-forward population behind the root cut, not regressions and not a count to net against incumbents. DeclarationRef deliberately replaces emitted line positions, which decay on regeneration; multiplicity remains part of each identity."

// CODELESS IS A FIRST-CLASS PARTITION. A code-keyed census reports 64 and silently loses this
// row; the explicit reconciliation is the receipt. Its repair belongs to the declaration-bound
// formal carrier transaction, where emission is the third consumer beside compatibility and
// inhabitance, not to a witness-specific parallel carrier.
data type_reference_containment_binding_codeless_emission_consumer_receipt: String = "The typed split-census reconciliation is coded 64 + codeless 1 = total 65. The codeless identity is v2.compiler.compile::apply_compile_lens_introspect — witness carrier type arg unresolved for variant Violates. infer_call_arguments_generic_pass computes the substituted formal and build_call_application_plan retains formal_subst transiently, but the emitted argument carries neither; rust_witness_type_arg_for_variant therefore cannot recover Witness<Node>. Emission is the third consumer of the single declaration-bound formal authority and requires its substitution basis. The direct-call formal-carrier lane owns that repair; this containment-binding authority retains only its downstream receipt and must not mint a parallel carrier."

data type_reference_containment_binding_scaffold: Disposition = Scaffold {
  dissolves_to: SingleAuthority,
  bind: DeclarationRef {
    module_path: "std.occurrence_binding_candidates" as NonEmptyStr,
    decl_name: "resolve_type_reference_containment_binding" as NonEmptyStr,
    field: WholeDeclaration
  }
}

data type_reference_containment_binding_dissolve_on: DissolutionCondition = unbound_dissolution(description: "DISSOLVE-ON: v1 type positions consume std.occurrence_binding_candidates.resolve_type_reference_containment_binding by execution (not a parallel lookup), N1a measure predicate deletes per gunbc.type_ref_hit_ne_bind_measure type_ref_hit_ne_bind_measure_dissolve_trigger, and flat lookup-as-binding paths retain only migration-oracle status until census parity. This authority module deletes when the d")
